 "structural_change": "COMPOSED-BUDGET relay (S81 VM owner, 2026-10-15): the closed native_option relay launches 256-371 ps flop->pin (DFFHQNx1 QN 106 + INVx1 123 + unconditional FIRM outhold BUF-HB2-BUF 140 ps, probe o_sd[321]) against a 0.2T outside budget, so 27,344 of 83,712 composed bank/quarter/bridge bits fail TT (min -109.5 ps). The composed hold race is already carried by the receivers' measured input pads (FF hold -56..-94 ps) + the 100 ps H1 reserve, so the unconditional output hold stage is removed (route hold repair keeps the child's own 50+25 ps sender min) and every output domain takes a composition-derived 0.6T outside budget (launch <= ~196 ps at sign-off, <= ~133 ps at the 770 ps route). Same RTL, pins, outline, two roots, zero cycles.",
